  "description": "Prompt Decorators are structured prefixes, such as +++Reasoning and +++StepByStep, designed to enhance AI responses. Inspired by Python decorators, they make AI outputs more logical, accurate, and well-organized without requiring lengthy instructions, simplifying interactions for users.",
